NANO
====

Simple text editor.


BASIC
-----
nano file.txt

Opens file in editor.

Create new file:
  nano newfile.txt


COMMANDS
--------
Ctrl+O          Save (write out)
Ctrl+X          Exit
Ctrl+K          Delete line
Ctrl+U          Undo
Ctrl+Y          Redo
Ctrl+A          Go to start of line
Ctrl+E          Go to end of line


NAVIGATION
----------
Arrow keys      Move cursor
Page Up/Down    Scroll
Ctrl+Home       Start of file
Ctrl+End        End of file


FIND & REPLACE
---------------
Ctrl+W          Search
Ctrl+\          Find & replace


SAVE & EXIT
-----------
Ctrl+O + Enter  Save
Ctrl+X          Exit
Ctrl+X (unsaved) Ask to save


TIPS
----
Easiest editor for beginners.
Perfect for quick edits.
Press ? for help inside nano.
